OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 1,000 object to poultry
OL,4,Aprocessing plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,000 objections have been
OL,7,Flodged over a proposed chicken farm
OL,8,Fnear a village due to concerns it would
OL,9,Fproduce unpleasant smells and lorry
OL,10,Ftraffic.
OL,12,FBased near the Europarc industrial
OL,13,Festate in Healing, the facility would
OL,14,Fprocess up to 1.75 million birds per
OL,15,Fweek - with a maximum workforce of
OL,16,F1,400 employees.
OL,18,FAbout 40 residents attended a meeting
OL,19,Fat Great Coates Village Hall to oppose
OL,20,Fthe plans by food producer Cranswick,
OL,21,Fwhich they said would harm local
OL,22,Flivelihoods and the environment.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
