OL,5,
OL,6,FA Cranswick spokesperson said: "We're
OL,7,Flooking at a #200m investment creating
OL,8,F1,400 jobs in an area that has been
OL,9,Fformally designated as suitable for
OL,10,Ffood production and industrial
OL,11,Fdevelopment."
